\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The Lord God is my Shepherd;\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And never shall I want.
\par He keeps me and nurtures me,
\par His best gifts He gives me.
\par In trouble he consoles my soul;
\par And leads me by His safest way.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Though I walk thro' deaths' dark vale,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 I shall yet fear no evil.
\par For its' you that follow me
\par And give me your comfort.
\par And you, Jehovah, by Your rod,
\par Will scatter all my enemies
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  You feast me before my foes,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Anoint my head with oil;
\par And my cup does overflow,
\par Goodness shall follow me.
\par In Jehovah's house I shall live
\par \pard       His goodness to forever see.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

